-- Quest-starting loot items that could never drop (game-wide).
-- Found via Avruu's Orb, Burning Legion Missive and Crimson Crystal Shard: an
-- item that STARTS a quest (ItemSparse StartQuestID) but whose loot row has
-- QuestRequired=1 only shows when a quest already in the log needs it
-- (Player::HasQuestForItem). Most of these items are also the objective of the
-- very quest they start, which you can't have before looting them, so they
-- never drop. Without the flag the core still hides the item once its quest
-- is taken or done (LootItem::AllowedForPlayer StartQuestID check).
-- Scope: creature_loot_template and gameobject_loot_template rows with
-- QuestRequired=1 whose item starts a live quest (quest exists, not retired
-- Flags 0x4000), unless the item is also an objective or ItemDrop of some OTHER
-- quest (those can already drop for that quest).
-- Only the flag changes; drop chances are left as they are.
-- 2554 creature rows + 89 gameobject rows, 303 items.
-- Raging Colossus 19188 / Crimson Crystal Shard 29476 (Crimson Crystal Clue 10134) is one of them.

